 "source": "issue #761 diagnostics of one Stream Pro (BK12) unit, recorded by unze on 2026-11-23 while the Android app switched AC outlet 2 on and off and AC outlet 1 off and on. Kept: the app writes the recording holds, every device acknowledgement of an outlet write, and the two reports that carry an outlet state (field 982 = 1 after outlet 2 on, field 980 = 1 after outlet 1 on). The recording holds no app write for outlet 2 off and no report of an off state; the outlet 1 on write is the app's repeat under the sequence of the first acknowledgement. The integration masked the serial bytes as X. frame_index is the position in the BK12 device's recorded frames.",
